%% MUPP-015 Back button on kids card
%% How a visitor gets back to all the kids; labels are requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[Kid opened on a card with several kids or Christmas Eve] --> B[Tillbaka in the top left corner, first in tab order R1 R3]
    A --> C[Stäng at the bottom, and Esc]
    B --> D[close: list closed, marks forgotten, deck unlocked R2]
    C --> D
    D --> E[All the kids shown again, focus on that kid's button, announcement: Kortleken är upplåst]
    F[Card with one kid] --> G[No Tillbaka: the arrow up folds the list R1]
